   "en": "A nostalgic and fresh newcomer! A story of a happy and joyful music town\nThis is Eitapan. A world of music full of sound and joy. Miri is a small flute player who dreams of becoming the best player, Eitapa Neechi, but she is still not very good at it. Today, she enjoys a fun session with Master Pokke and her friends in Eitapan!"
